												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">What is AI SEO and how is it different from traditional SEO?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-10213" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="13" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-10213"><p>Traditional SEO optimized a URL to rank in Google’s ten blue links. AI SEO optimizes your brand to be understood, cited, and recommended across both classical search engines and generative AI surfaces — Google AI Overviews, ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini, and Claude. It still depends on the SEO fundamentals (technical health, schema, authority, content quality), but the success metric shifts from keyword ranking to citation share and branded query growth.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-10214" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="14" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-10214" aria-expanded="false">
