												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">Will AI search kill organic SEO traffic? Should I still invest?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-10216" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="16" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-10216"><p>Organic clicks to informational content are declining as zero-click AI answers grow — that part is real. But two things are also true: high-intent, commercial, and branded queries still convert through clicks, and the brands cited inside AI answers are seeing brand search lift, direct traffic lift, and higher trust at the consideration stage. The right move in 2026 is not to abandon SEO; it’s to rebalance the budget toward GEO/AEO, branded content, original research, and bottom-of-funnel pages. Digiexe’s hybrid retainers explicitly split effort between classic SEO and AI visibility.</p></div>
