												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">How do you use AI internally at Digiexe without sacrificing quality or E-E-A-T?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-10217" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="17" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-10217"><p>We use AI for the parts of the workflow where it genuinely outperforms humans — keyword and topic clustering, SERP and AI-Overview analysis, technical audits, internal linking maps, first-draft outlines, schema generation, reporting, and competitor intel. We do not publish unedited AI content. Every page that goes live passes through a human SME, an editor, and a fact-checker, and we add original quotes, screenshots, data, or first-hand testing wherever possible. This is the single biggest factor in whether Google’s helpful content systems and LLMs treat your content as authoritative versus disposable.</p></div>
