												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">How much does Digiexe cost and what are the engagement models?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-10218" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="18" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-10218"><p>Digiexe offers three engagement models. Project-based (one-off audits, GEO audits, website builds, migrations) typically starts in the low four figures USD. Monthly retainers for SEO, GEO, content, and paid scale based on scope, typically ranging from a few hundred dollars per month for SMB local SEO up to five-figure monthly retainers for enterprise programs. Performance or equity-linked partnerships are available on a selective basis for funded startups. Every engagement begins with a free discovery call and a custom proposal — we do not publish fixed pricing because honest pricing depends on your competitive landscape, current site state, and goals.</p></div>
				</div>
