												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">How long until I see results from an AI SEO or GEO engagement?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-10219" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="19" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-10219"><p>Honest answer, no fluff: technical and on-page wins typically show in 30–60 days. Meaningful organic traffic and citation lift in AI engines usually start between months 3 and 6, with compounding gains from month 6 onward. Brands with an existing authority footprint move faster; brand-new domains take longer because LLMs and Google both need time to verify entity signals. We share a realistic milestone roadmap in the kickoff document so you’re never guessing.</p></div>
				</div>
