												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">How do I get started with Digiexe?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-10220" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="20" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-10220"><p>Three steps. First, send a brief through digiexe.com/contact-us or email <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="472e29212807232e202e223f226924282a">[email&#160;protected]</a>. Second, we run a free 30-minute discovery call to understand your goals, market, and current performance. Third, within 5–7 working days you receive a custom proposal with scope, deliverables, timelines, KPIs, and pricing. If it’s a fit, we kick off within two weeks. You can also reach the team on +91 93113 75051 or connect with Jitendra Vaswani directly on LinkedIn.</p></div>
				</div>
										<script data-cfasync="false" src="/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js"></script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Digiexe and what does the agency do?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Digiexe is an AI-powered digital marketing agency headquartered in India with operations in the USA and a Dubai office. We deliver an integrated stack of services \u2014 SEO, Generative Engine Optimization (GEO), Answer Engine Optimization (AEO), PPC, social media marketing, content, web design and development, affiliate marketing, and AI automation \u2014 under one roof. Our differentiator is a proprietary AI engine layered on top of human strategists, which means faster research, sharper targeting, and measurable ROI for brands across India and the USA.<\/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"When was Digiexe founded and who runs it?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Digiexe was founded in 2014 by Jitendra Vaswani, who continues to serve as CEO. Jitendra is a globally recognized SEO and digital marketing speaker, the founder of BloggersIdeas.com and AffiliateBooster, and the author of Inside A Hustler\u2019s Brain. The agency operates as Digiexe Limited and is publicly recommended by industry leaders including Neil Patel.<\/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What industries does Digiexe specialize in?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>We work with SaaS, ecommerce, D2C, finance, EdTech, hospitality, B2B services, affiliate publishers, and personal brands. Our experience spans both Indian SMBs scaling globally and US\/UK companies looking for cost-efficient, high-quality execution. Roughly 1,500+ businesses across 28+ countries have used our services.<\/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where is Digiexe located and do you work with international clients?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Yes, the majority of our revenue comes from international clients. Our core delivery teams sit in India, with client-facing teams in the USA and a registered office in Clover Bay Tower, Dubai (UAE). We service clients in any timezone and have active engagements across North America, Europe, Middle East, and APAC.<\/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What makes Digiexe different from other digital marketing or AI SEO agencies?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Three things. First, an AI-powered core: our internal AI tooling handles keyword clustering, SERP and AI-Overview analysis, content briefs, technical audits, and competitor intelligence at a scale a manual team cannot match. Second, a fully integrated approach \u2014 your SEO, content, paid, and dev teams sit under one roof, so nothing falls between agencies. Third, founder-led strategy \u2014 every retainer benefits from Jitendra Vaswani\u2019s strategic input, not just a junior account manager.<\/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What kind of results have Digiexe clients seen?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Typical outcomes published on our site include 2x\u20136x revenue lift, 3x\u20138x improvement in qualified leads, 4x\u20138x growth from social channels, and 100%\u20131000% increases in branded search and brand exposure for clients who stay engaged for 6\u201312 months. Results vary by industry, starting baseline, and budget \u2014 we share realistic projections after our initial audit, not before.<\/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Digiexe only do SEO, or full-funnel marketing?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Full-funnel. While SEO and GEO are our flagship services, most retainers also include some combination of paid media (Google, Meta, LinkedIn), content production, conversion rate optimization, email and marketing automation, web development, and AI automation workflows. We can also plug in as a specialist GEO\/AEO partner alongside your existing agency.<\/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Digiexe a white-label partner for other agencies?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Yes. We white-label SEO, content, link building, and web development for marketing agencies in the USA, UK, Australia, and Canada that need a reliable execution partner. Contracts include strict NDAs and we never approach your clients directly.<\/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who is Jitendra Vaswani?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Jitendra Vaswani is the founder and CEO of Digiexe and one of India\u2019s most internationally recognized SEO and affiliate marketing experts. He started BloggersIdeas.com in 2013, founded AffiliateBooster, has spoken at marketing conferences across the US, UK, Thailand, Vietnam, the UAE, and India, and has interviewed thought leaders including Neil Patel, Rand Fishkin, and Grant Cardone. He is also the author of Inside A Hustler\u2019s Brain.<\/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Jitendra Vaswani\u2019s philosophy on AI and SEO?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>In recent interviews on RedTrack, Champions of Performance Marketing, and his LinkedIn essays on the \u201cLLM shift,\u201d Jitendra has been consistent on one point: AI accelerates execution but authenticity wins distribution. He advocates a hybrid model where AI handles research, drafts, clustering, and reporting, while humans handle original POV, first-hand experience, expert quotes, and brand voice \u2014 because those are the exact signals LLMs use to decide who to cite.<\/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I work directly with Jitendra Vaswani on my project?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Jitendra is personally involved in strategy for enterprise retainers, GEO\/AEO engagements above a certain spend threshold, and select advisory engagements. For smaller projects, you\u2019ll work with a senior strategist trained in his playbooks while Jitendra reviews quarterly strategy. Speaking, podcast, and consulting requests can be made through the Digiexe contact form.<\/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Jitendra Vaswani offer training, courses, or coaching?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Yes. Through BloggersIdeas, AffiliateBooster, and Digiexe, Jitendra runs occasional cohorts and 1:1 advisory for affiliate marketers, SaaS founders, and agency owners covering SEO, GEO, link building, and affiliate scaling. Availability is limited and is announced on his LinkedIn (@jitendravaswaniseo) and Instagram (@jitendravaswani).<\/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is AI SEO and how is it different from traditional SEO?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Traditional SEO optimized a URL to rank in Google\u2019s ten blue links. AI SEO optimizes your brand to be understood, cited, and recommended across both classical search engines and generative AI surfaces \u2014 Google AI Overviews, ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini, and Claude. It still depends on the SEO fundamentals (technical health, schema, authority, content quality), but the success metric shifts from keyword ranking to citation share and branded query growth.<\/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the difference between SEO, GEO, AEO, and LLMO?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>SEO (Search Engine Optimization) is ranking in classic search results. AEO (Answer Engine Optimization) is structuring content so it can be extracted as a direct answer by features like AI Overviews, featured snippets, and voice assistants. GEO (Generative Engine Optimization) is engineering your brand and content to be selected and cited by generative AI engines when they synthesize an answer. LLMO (Large Language Model Optimization) is the broader discipline of shaping how LLMs perceive your brand entity across their training data and live retrieval. Digiexe treats all four as one unified strategy because the underlying signals \u2014 entity clarity, authoritative citations, structured data, and unique information gain \u2014 overlap heavily.<\/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do you get a brand cited by ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini, and Google AI Overviews?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Six things, in priority order: build a clean, machine-readable entity (consistent NAP, sameAs links, JSON-LD Organization schema, Wikidata or Wikipedia presence where eligible); publish content with information gain \u2014 original data, expert quotes, first-hand experience \u2014 that LLMs cannot find elsewhere; format pages as self-contained answer blocks with a direct one-sentence answer in the first 50 words of each H2 or H3; earn citations from sources LLMs already trust (Reddit, YouTube, G2, Clutch, industry publications, Wikipedia-tier outlets); implement FAQ, HowTo, Article, Product, and Review schema; and monitor and benchmark share of model monthly using tools like Profound, Peec AI, or our internal Digiexe AI visibility tracker.<\/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Will AI search kill organic SEO traffic? Should I still invest?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Organic clicks to informational content are declining as zero-click AI answers grow \u2014 that part is real. But two things are also true: high-intent, commercial, and branded queries still convert through clicks, and the brands cited inside AI answers are seeing brand search lift, direct traffic lift, and higher trust at the consideration stage. The right move in 2026 is not to abandon SEO; it\u2019s to rebalance the budget toward GEO\/AEO, branded content, original research, and bottom-of-funnel pages. Digiexe\u2019s hybrid retainers explicitly split effort between classic SEO and AI visibility.<\/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do you use AI internally at Digiexe without sacrificing quality or E-E-A-T?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>We use AI for the parts of the workflow where it genuinely outperforms humans \u2014 keyword and topic clustering, SERP and AI-Overview analysis, technical audits, internal linking maps, first-draft outlines, schema generation, reporting, and competitor intel. We do not publish unedited AI content. Every page that goes live passes through a human SME, an editor, and a fact-checker, and we add original quotes, screenshots, data, or first-hand testing wherever possible. This is the single biggest factor in whether Google\u2019s helpful content systems and LLMs treat your content as authoritative versus disposable.<\/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does Digiexe cost and what are the engagement models?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Digiexe offers three engagement models. Project-based (one-off audits, GEO audits, website builds, migrations) typically starts in the low four figures USD. Monthly retainers for SEO, GEO, content, and paid scale based on scope, typically ranging from a few hundred dollars per month for SMB local SEO up to five-figure monthly retainers for enterprise programs. Performance or equity-linked partnerships are available on a selective basis for funded startups. Every engagement begins with a free discovery call and a custom proposal \u2014 we do not publish fixed pricing because honest pricing depends on your competitive landscape, current site state, and goals.<\/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long until I see results from an AI SEO or GEO engagement?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Honest answer, no fluff: technical and on-page wins typically show in 30\u201360 days. Meaningful organic traffic and citation lift in AI engines usually start between months 3 and 6, with compounding gains from month 6 onward. Brands with an existing authority footprint move faster; brand-new domains take longer because LLMs and Google both need time to verify entity signals. We share a realistic milestone roadmap in the kickoff document so you\u2019re never guessing.<\/p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I get started with Digiexe?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Three steps. First, send a brief through digiexe.com\/contact-us or email info@digiexe.com. Second, we run a free 30-minute discovery call to understand your goals, market, and current performance. Third, within 5\u20137 working days you receive a custom proposal with scope, deliverables, timelines, KPIs, and pricing. If it\u2019s a fit, we kick off within two weeks. You can also reach the team on +91 93113 75051 or connect with Jitendra Vaswani directly on LinkedIn.<\/p>"}}]}</script>
